<div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto;">
<p style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(134, 134, 139); margin: 0px 0px 14px;">08 · Operating Principles</p>
<h2 style="font-size: clamp(38px, 4vw, 52px); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.08; margin: 0px 0px 48px;">Four rules that decide everything else.</h2>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(380px, 1fr)); gap: 16px;">
<div style="border: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 231); border-radius: 16px; padding: 32px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin: 0px 0px 16px;"><svg fill="none" height="22" stroke="#86868B" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="22"><path d="M4 6v12M7.5 6v12M10.5 6v8M14 6v12M17 6v9M20 6v12"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(134, 134, 139);">01</span></div><h3 style="font-size: clamp(22px, 2.2vw, 28px); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0px 0px 10px;">The part number is the hero.</h3><p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgb(110, 110, 115); margin: 0px;">Marketing copy doesn't survive a bid. The SKU, the spec string, and the date code do. Every page, label, and spec sheet we publish is built around the part number.</p></div>
<div style="border: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 231); border-radius: 16px; padding: 32px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin: 0px 0px 16px;"><svg fill="none" height="22" stroke="#86868B" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="22"><path d="M3 8.5h18M3 15.5h18"></path><rect height="4" width="4" x="5.5" y="4.5"></rect><rect height="4" width="4" x="14" y="11.5"></rect></svg><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(134, 134, 139);">02</span></div><h3 style="font-size: clamp(22px, 2.2vw, 28px); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0px 0px 10px;">The shelf decides.</h3><p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgb(110, 110, 115); margin: 0px;">Thirty years of retail taught us the shelf is the truth: if the product doesn't arrive right, priced right, on time, nothing else matters. The C&amp;I catalog runs on the same rule.</p></div>
<div style="border: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 231); border-radius: 16px; padding: 32px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin: 0px 0px 16px;"><svg fill="none" height="22" stroke="#86868B" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="22"><rect height="16" rx="1" width="7" x="3.5" y="4"></rect><rect height="16" rx="1" width="7" x="13.5" y="4"></rect><circle cx="9" cy="12" fill="#86868B" r=".8" stroke="none"></circle><circle cx="19" cy="12" fill="#86868B" r=".8" stroke="none"></circle></svg><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(134, 134, 139);">03</span></div><h3 style="font-size: clamp(22px, 2.2vw, 28px); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0px 0px 10px;">Two channels, one catalog.</h3><p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgb(110, 110, 115); margin: 0px;">Retail and C&amp;I never compete for the same SKU. Two sales motions, two price books — one engineering and quality system underneath.</p></div>
<div style="border: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 231); border-radius: 16px; padding: 32px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin: 0px 0px 16px;"><svg fill="none" height="22" stroke="#86868B" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="22"><path d="M3 21V9l5.5 3.5V9l5.5 3.5V9l7-2.5V21z"></path><path d="M7 17h2M12 17h2M17 17h2"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(134, 134, 139);">04</span></div><h3 style="font-size: clamp(22px, 2.2vw, 28px); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0px 0px 10px;">Engineered in California, built where it ships best.</h3><p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgb(110, 110, 115); margin: 0px;">Design, photometry, and final QC live in Montclair and Riverside. Production goes where it serves the program — US, Mexico, China, or Thailand — with COO stated on every product.</p></div>
</div>
</div></section><section data-screen-label="09 Timeline" id="timeline" style="padding: 104px 24px; border-top: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 231);">
<div style="max-width: 980px; margin: 0px auto;">
