<div style="display: grid;">
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 88px 28px 1fr; gap: 14px; padding: 0px 0px 36px;"><span style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; text-align: right; padding-top: 1px;">1997</span><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; align-self: stretch;"><div style="width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgb(29, 29, 31); flex: 0 0 auto; margin-top: 6px;"></div><div style="flex: 1 1 0%; width: 2px; background: rgb(229, 229, 231); margin-top: 6px;"></div></div><div><h3 style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0px 0px 4px;">Founded in Montclair, CA</h3><p style="font-size: 15px; color: rgb(110, 110, 115); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0px;">An OEM and white-label lighting manufacturer, building to retail program spec from day one.</p></div></div>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 88px 28px 1fr; gap: 14px; padding: 0px 0px 36px;"><span style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; text-align: right; padding-top: 1px;">2001</span><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; align-self: stretch;"><div style="width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgb(29, 29, 31); flex: 0 0 auto; margin-top: 6px;"></div><div style="flex: 1 1 0%; width: 2px; background: rgb(229, 229, 231); margin-top: 6px;"></div></div><div><h3 style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0px 0px 4px;">First national retail program ships</h3><p style="font-size: 15px; color: rgb(110, 110, 115); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0px;">The first planogram win — and the first quarterly factory audit passed.</p></div></div>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 88px 28px 1fr; gap: 14px; padding: 0px 0px 36px;"><span style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; text-align: right; padding-top: 1px;">2008</span><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; align-self: stretch;"><div style="width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgb(29, 29, 31); flex: 0 0 auto; margin-top: 6px;"></div><div style="flex: 1 1 0%; width: 2px; background: rgb(229, 229, 231); margin-top: 6px;"></div></div><div><h3 style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0px 0px 4px;">12-warehouse US footprint completed</h3><p style="font-size: 15px; color: rgb(110, 110, 115); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0px;">Same-week replenishment coverage for every national account.</p></div></div>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 88px 28px 1fr; gap: 14px; padding: 0px 0px 36px;"><span style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; text-align: right; padding-top: 1px;">2012</span><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; align-self: stretch;"><div style="width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgb(29, 29, 31); flex: 0 0 auto; margin-top: 6px;"></div><div style="flex: 1 1 0%; width: 2px; background: rgb(229, 229, 231); margin-top: 6px;"></div></div><div><h3 style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0px 0px 4px;">PolyGrow launches</h3><p style="font-size: 15px; color: rgb(110, 110, 115); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0px;">The first ALG-owned brand program reaches retail shelves.</p></div></div>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 88px 28px 1fr; gap: 14px; padding: 0px 0px 36px;"><span style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; text-align: right; padding-top: 1px;">2014</span><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; align-self: stretch;"><div style="width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgb(29, 29, 31); flex: 0 0 auto; margin-top: 6px;"></div><div style="flex: 1 1 0%; width: 2px; background: rgb(229, 229, 231); margin-top: 6px;"></div></div><div><h3 style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0px 0px 4px;">Two-channel structure formalized</h3><p style="font-size: 15px; color: rgb(110, 110, 115); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0px;">Separate sales organizations and price books; the zero channel-conflict policy is adopted.</p></div></div>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 88px 28px 1fr; gap: 14px; padding: 0px 0px 36px;"><span style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; text-align: right; padding-top: 1px;">2015</span><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; align-self: stretch;"><div style="width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgb(29, 29, 31); flex: 0 0 auto; margin-top: 6px;"></div><div style="flex: 1 1 0%; width: 2px; background: rgb(229, 229, 231); margin-top: 6px;"></div></div><div><h3 style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0px 0px 4px;">Riverside, CA production opens</h3><p style="font-size: 15px; color: rgb(110, 110, 115); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0px;">US driver assembly and final QA come in-house.</p></div></div>
